  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW GOOD IS THE QUALITY</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS THE QUALITY GOOD</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I TRUST THE QUALITY</pattern>
    <template>Our portfolio speaks to the standard we hold every commission to — broadcast-ready, emotionally intentional, and built around your story. Every package also includes three revision rounds, so we don't deliver until the song is genuinely right.
      <nav-card label="Listen to Our Work" href="/music" description="Commissioned portfolio"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO I KNOW IT WILL BE GOOD</pattern>
    <template><srai>CAN I TRUST THE QUALITY</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I HEAR SAMPLES</pattern>
    <template>Our commissioned portfolio is available on the Music page — you can listen to a range of styles and occasions to get a sense of the work we produce. Every commission is original and built entirely around its client's story.
      <nav-card label="Music Portfolio" href="/music" description="Hear commissioned work"/>
    </template>
  </category>

