  <!-- ── Quality and process ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO YOU MAKE THE MUSIC SO GOOD</pattern>
    <template>It starts with genuine musical craft — real songwriters shaping the lyrics and creative arc around your story. We use advanced AI-assisted production tools to bring those creative decisions to life at broadcast quality. The discipline is the same regardless of package size: no templates, no shortcuts, every commission built from scratch.
      <nav-card label="Our Process" href="/about"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS YOUR QUALITY STANDARD</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS THE QUALITY GOOD</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO YOU ENSURE QUALITY</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS THE QUALITY GOOD</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO YOU RESEARCH</pattern>
    <template>Our process begins with a discovery conversation — we learn your story, the occasion, the people involved, and the emotional tone you're after. That research phase is what makes each commission genuinely original; we don't write from templates, we write from what you share with us.
      <nav-card label="Start Your Commission" href="/contact" description="Tell us your story"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE SCIENCE BEHIND IT</pattern>
    <template><srai>HOW DOES SUNO WORK</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Terminology: atelier and bespoke ──────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS AN ATELIER</pattern>
    <template>Atelier is the French word for a craftsman's workshop — a place where bespoke work is made by hand, to order, for a single client. We use it deliberately: Brass Note Studios isn't a template service or a factory; every commission is shaped by skilled hands around one person's story.
      <nav-card label="About the Studio" href="/about"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT DOES ATELIER MEAN</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS AN ATELIER</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS BESPOKE</pattern>
    <template>Bespoke means made specifically for one person — not pulled from a shelf, not adapted from a template. Every commission we write begins completely from scratch, shaped entirely around the client, the occasion, and the story they bring us. Nothing leaves our studio as a one-size-fits-all product.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT DOES BESPOKE MEAN</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS BESPOKE</srai></template>
  </category>

